<div>Dear <%= @name %>,</div>

<p>
  This is a notification that your <%= @scope %> token for Academic Commons API Access is set to expire on <%= @expiration_date %>.
</p>

<%# Currently, users can only manage their own API tokens; MCP and data feed tokens are managed by admin %>
<% if @scope == Token::API%>
  <p>
    Please visit the account settings page to generate a new token. Make sure to update your token to the new value in any programs that use it.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    Please contact an Academic Commons administrator to generate a new <%= @scope %> token. You can contact by email at <a href='ac@columbia.edu'>ac@columbia.edu</a>.
  </p>
<% end %>


<div>
  Sincerely,
  Academic Commons
  Columbia University Libraries
</div>
